Technical Design Document v2: Configurable Rule Engine
1. Handling Complex Grouping Logic & Justifications
To handle complex boolean expressions such as (Q1 = Yes AND Q2 = NO) OR (Q1 = Yes AND Q3 = Yes), we use standard Disjunctive Normal Form (DNF).

In DNF, complex conditions are broken down into an OR of ANDs.

AND Logic: Modeled across multiple rows in the RULE_CONDITION table sharing the same RULE_ID.

OR Logic: Modeled as separate RULE_ID records targeting the same DISPOSITION_ID.

Each individual BUSINESS_RULE represents a distinct path to achieving a disposition and contains its own dedicated Justification Template.

